        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SNJ4020HMRSSTFRD, Hand Forged Castle Sconce Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Castle Sconce Door Pull features a hand forged, hammer grip and decorative eyelet mounts. Its unique styling harkens back to the old world, making this door pull great for period homes. The Hand Forged Castle Sconce Door Pull is 20-1/6 inches overall with 7-7/8 inch mounting centers. Choose from a huge selection of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door. Standard for 1-1/4\" or thicker wood, composite or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions SNJ4020HMRSSTFRD 20 Inch San Juan Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 7-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-SNJ04-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262330\"><b>First Impressions SNJ04020 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</i>\r\n</p>",
