                "description": "The Castle Sconce Door Pull features a hand forged, hammer grip and decorative eyelet mounts. Its unique styling harkens back to the old world, making this door pull great for period homes. The Hand Forged Castle Sconce Door Pull is 20-1/6 inches overall with 7-7/8 inch mounting centers. Choose from a huge selection of finishes.",
